  </button>
  <ul class="profile-links" id="profile-links">
    <li><i class="bi bi-geo-alt"></i><span>Yogyakarta, Indonesia</span></li>
    <li><a href="mailto:achmad.solaeman@ugm.ac.id"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i><span>Email</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/solaemanachmad/"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i><span>LinkedIn</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/solaemanachmad/"><i class="bi bi-instagram"></i><span>Instagram</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/solaemanachmad"><i class="bi bi-github"></i><span>GitHub</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=sPEG30wAAAAJ"><i class="ai ai-google-scholar"></i><span>Google Scholar</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0002-9620-7411"><i class="ai ai-orcid"></i><span>ORCID</span></a></li>
    <!-- Jadwal konsultasi: isi data-url dengan link Google Calendar Appointment / Cal.com.
         Selama data-url kosong, baris ini disembunyikan. -->
    <li class="profile-booking" hidden=""><a data-url="" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check"></i><span>Book a meeting</span></a></li>
    <li><a class="profile-cv" data-href="cv/index.html"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-person"></i><span>Curriculum Vitae</span></a></li>
  </ul>
</aside>
<script>
  // Path foto & link CV relatif ke root situs (berfungsi juga di subfolder seperti posts/)
  (function () {
    var meta = document.querySelector('meta[name="quarto:offset"]');
    var offset = meta ? meta.getAttribute("content") : "./";
    document.querySelectorAll(".profile-photo[data-src]").forEach(function (img) {
      img.src = offset + img.getAttribute("data-src");
    });
    document.querySelectorAll(".profile-cv[data-href]").forEach(function (a) {
      a.href = offset + a.getAttribute("data-href");
    });

    // Tombol jadwal konsultasi: tampil hanya bila link sudah diisi
    var booking = document.querySelector(".profile-booking a");
    if (booking && booking.dataset.url) {
      booking.href = booking.dataset.url;
      booking.parentElement.hidden = false;
    }

    // Tandai halaman yang memakai komentar giscus (kotak Discussion di About hanya tampil bila aktif)
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
      if (document.getElementById("giscus-base-theme")) document.body.classList.add("has-giscus");
    });

    // Menu aktif untuk subhalaman (nav-parent): courses/... → Teaching, posts/... → Posts
    var parents = { "/courses/": "teaching.html", "/posts/": "posts.html" };
    Object.keys(parents).forEach(function (dir) {
      if (location.pathname.indexOf(dir) === -1) return;
      document.querySelectorAll(".navbar .nav-link").forEach(function (link) {
        var href = link.getAttribute("href") || "";
        if (href.split("/").pop() === parents[dir]) {
          link.classList.add("active");
          link.setAttribute("aria-current", "page");
        }
      });
    });

    // Tombol Follow (mobile): buka/tutup daftar kontak
    var btn = document.querySelector(".profile-follow");
    var box = document.querySelector(".profile-sidebar");
    if (!btn || !box) return;
    function setOpen(open) {
      box.classList.toggle("links-open", open);
      btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", open ? "true" : "false");
    }
    btn.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
      e.stopPropagation();
      setOpen(!box.classList.contains("links-open"));
    });
    document.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
      if (!e.target.closest(".profile-links")) setOpen(false);
    });
    document.addEventListener("keydown", function (e) {
      if (e.key === "Escape") setOpen(false);
    });
  })();
</script>




<p>In April 2026 I received the <strong>Hibah Riset dan Pembuatan Artikel Publikasi 2026</strong> (Research and Publication Article Grant 2026) from <a href="https://sv.ugm.ac.id/">Sekolah Vokasi, Universitas Gadjah Mada</a>, under the <strong>Competitive (Kompetitif)</strong> cluster.</p>
<p>The grant funds my project <strong><a href="../../research.html#project-rca-network-faults">Intelligent Root Cause Analysis System for Network Faults</a></strong>, which combines time-series analysis of network telemetry with a large language model to identify, and explain, the underlying cause of network faults.</p>
<p>Students interested in contributing can find open positions and related thesis topics on the <a href="../../research.html#join">Research</a> page.</p>
